## New feature workflow

When user says a feature launched / “update features” / “new feature”:
1. Analyze plugin + app (and backend package keys if needed) — follow the **Feature discovery → SEO opportunity loop** in `.cursor/skills/seo-mentor/SKILL.md` for scan targets and classification.
2. Update `FEATURES.md` (shipped vs coming-soon).
3. Add resulting keyword / FAQ / landing rows to `config/seo_keyword_inventory.php` (Blog AI reads it automatically).
4. Use that feature as the next daily social/SEO theme.

Never claim unlisted or “Coming soon” features (e.g. Meta AI Bot) as live.

